  "details": "The new avatar stats screen just plugs into the avatar menu's stat screen and shows us other people's avatars like they're our own.  \nOptimization aside, this bypasses all avatar safeties and jeopardizes user safety as a result, as crasher avatars can fire on awake, and there's a bug that can cause avatars in the menu to show with active animations so even if the crash is a triggered animation it may fire anyway.",
